<title>CHINA: China forex reserves $121.2 bln at end-June.</title>
<headline>China forex reserves $121.2 bln at end-June.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's foreign exchange reserves reached $121.2 billion at the end of June, the Xinhua news agency said on Friday.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
<p>China's foreign reserves had reached $117.6 billion at the end of May and $105 billion at the start of this year.</p>
<p>China has said it expects the reserves to grow by at least $20 billion this year.</p>
</text>
